{"about_the_game":"Hell\u2019s armies have invaded Earth. Become the Slayer in an epic single-player campaign to conquer demons across dimensions and stop the final destruction of humanity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Only Thing they Fear... Is You.</h2><br>Experience the ultimate combination of speed and power in DOOM Eternal - the next leap in push-forward, first-person combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slayer Threat Level At Maximum</h2>Armed with a shoulder-mounted flamethrower, retractable wrist-mounted blade, upgraded guns and mods, and abilities, you're faster, stronger, and more versatile than ever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unholy Trinity</h2>Take what you need from your enemies: Glory kill for extra health, incinerate for armor, and chainsaw demons to stock up on ammo to become the ultimate demon-slayer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter Battlemode</h2>A new 2 versus 1 multiplayer experience. A fully-armed DOOM Slayer faces off against two player-controlled demons, fighting it out in a best-of-five round match of intense first-person combat.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Doomsday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/782330/df8994bdc1ff5d8f83e77d8025c2a2a3c113d158.jpg"},{"name":"The Hunters Became the Hunted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/782330/b155083414384537f2902765f40907fa968d7d22.jpg"},{"name":"Interplanetary Fracking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/782330/eacdbdc7dce642f019eed1f61eb4772f255df9ca.jpg"},{"name":"Thumbs Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/782330/6e5c74592352ddecb4e3cb8291fbeeb9ff87854e.jpg"},{"name":"Reforged and Refueled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/782330/a2176a79efc81b4dda80a5552a146bd8e3cfc2a1.jpg"},{"name":"Nontraditionalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/782330/cf9cb1